{"name":"Half-Smoke","hex":"#ee8855","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"half","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One of two usually roughly equal parts into which anything may be divided, or considered as divided.","One of two equal periods into which a game is divided."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Consisting of a half (½, 50%).","Consisting of some indefinite portion resembling a half; approximately a half, whether more or less; partial; imperfect."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/half"},{"term":"smoke","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The visible vapor/vapour, gases, and fine particles given off by burning or smoldering material.","A cigarette."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To inhale and exhale the smoke from a burning cigarette or cigar, burning material in a pipe, etc.","To inhale and exhale tobacco smoke."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/smoke"}],"entries":[{"title":"Half-smoke","blocks":[{"text":"A half-smoke is a type of hot dog found in Washington, D.C., and the surrounding region. Larger, spicier, and with more coarsely-ground meat than a regular hot dog, the sausage is often half-pork and half-beef, smoked, and served with herbs, onion, and chili sauce."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Weenie_Beenie_Halfsmokes.jpg/330px-Weenie_Beenie_Halfsmokes.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Half-smoke","wikidata":"Q3125942"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Chili_Half_Smoke_from_Ben%27s_Chili_Bowl_-_4496498687.jpg/500px-Chili_Half_Smoke_from_Ben%27s_Chili_Bowl_-_4496498687.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Chili_Half_Smoke_from_Ben%27s_Chili_Bowl_-_4496498687.jpg/1280px-Chili_Half_Smoke_from_Ben%27s_Chili_Bowl_-_44964986